      A. First Come First Serve


      B.
      Fastest Completion First Serve


      C. Fastest CPU First Serve


      D.
      First Cat First Serve'
    correctAnswerIndex: 0
  - prompt: 'What is a system call?


      A. Hardware failure


      B. Request
